menu "LunarOS Storage"

config LUNAREDU_STORAGE_POOL_USER_RESERVE_KIB
    int "Default managed-pool user reserve (KiB, 0 uses layout default)"
    default 0
    range 0 16384
    help
        Product deployment profiles may select a smaller or larger default
        reserve to fit their factory assets. Valid saved user preferences take
        precedence. Zero preserves the existing layout defaults (512 KiB for
        standard/recovery, 64 KiB for S31 vision). Free-space headroom and
        actual-volume admission checks remain enforced.

endmenu
